msgid "处理复合问题：coreDim + UB溢出"
msgstr "Handling compound issues: coreDim + UB overflow"

msgid "问题分析： 在某些情况下，解决了coreDim问题后可能引发新的UB溢出问题。这通常发生在增大BLOCK_SIZE后，单个线程块需要处理的数据量超出了NPU的UB缓存容量。"
msgstr "Problem analysis: In some cases, resolving the coreDim issue may trigger a new UB overflow issue. This usually occurs after increasing BLOCK_SIZE, when the amount of data a single thread block needs to process exceeds the NPU UB cache capacity."

msgid "案例： 数据规模：N = 1073741824，原始BLOCK_SIZE = 4096，计算得到的coreDim = 262144 > 65535（超限），调整为BLOCK_SIZE = 32768后，coreDim = 32768（合规），但出现UB溢出"
msgstr "Example: Data size: N = 1073741824, original BLOCK_SIZE = 4096, the calculated coreDim = 262144 > 65535 (exceeds the limit). After adjusting BLOCK_SIZE to 32768, coreDim = 32768 (compliant), but a UB overflow occurs."

msgid "解决思路： 引入BLOCK_SIZE_SUB参数，将大块进一步细分，在保持合理coreDim的同时控制内存使用。 优化前代码："
msgstr "Solution: Introduce the BLOCK_SIZE_SUB parameter to further subdivide large blocks, controlling memory usage while maintaining a reasonable coreDim. Code before optimization:"

msgid ""
"import logging\n"
"import torch\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def masked_fill_kernel(inp, expand_mask, value, out, N, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    offsets = pid * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < N\n"
"    fill_mask = tl.load(expand_mask + offsets, mask=mask, other=0).to(tl.int1)\n"
"    cur_inp = tl.load(inp + offsets, mask=(~fill_mask) & mask, other=0)\n"
"    tl.store(out + offsets, cur_inp, (~fill_mask) & mask)\n"
"    tl.store(out + offsets, value, fill_mask & mask)\n"
"\n"
"def masked_fill(inp, mask, value):\n"
"    # ... 参数验证代码 ...\n"
"    # inp.device = \"npu\"\n"
"    out = torch.zeros_like(inp)\n"
"    N = inp.numel()\n"
"    if N == 0:\n"
"        return out\n"
"\n"
"    grid = lambda meta: (triton.cdiv(N, 4096),)  # 导致coreDim超限\n"
"    masked_fill_kernel[grid](inp, mask.to(torch.int), value, out, N, 4096)\n"
"    return out\n"
